# Keeps caches, checkpoints, virtual environments and editor settings out of
# the repository (Requirement 4.12).
# Drafted with Claude (Anthropic). Asked for: a .gitignore for this project.
# The first five lines come from the course document "Starting and Shipping
# Your Project" (section "Keep the repository clean"). The last one keeps
# API keys and passwords out.
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.env
